data: {"id": "630dc3d24884401a-thinking-parallel_evidence-1256", "run_id": "630dc3d24884401a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我来整理当前已采集的可观测性事实，并制定下一步计划。\n\n## 当前事实整理\n\n### Kubernetes\n- 等待 kubectl_describe 结果，确认当前状态、Last State、Exit Code、重启次数。\n\n### Metrics (Prometheus)\n- **Pod UID**: `20db72b2-f223-4295-8f2d-62edd54cf1cd`\n- **容器**: app\n- **当前状态**: CrashLoopBackOff (kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason = 1)\n- **上次终止原因**: Error (kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason = 1, reason=\"Error\")\n- **重启次数**: 6 次\n- **当前 Pod Phase**: Running (但容器不 Ready)\n\n### Logging (Elasticsearch)\n- 最近30分钟有14条日志，全是 HTTP 请求日志。\n- 关键模式：交", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788437140881, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

