data: {"id": "630dc3d24884401a-thinking-parallel_evidence-1258", "run_id": "630dc3d24884401a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "TodoWrite", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=456 lines=8\nInvestigation plan updated with 4 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 0 completed, 1 in progress, 3 pending\n[ ] [step2] kubectl previous logs --", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788437140987, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_aa2a766d7f6b4f218f93257b", "tool_sequence": 1, "semantic_success": true, "result": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=456 lines=8\nInvestigation plan updated with 4 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 0 completed, 1 in progress, 3 pending\n[ ] [step2] kubectl previous logs --tail=200 - 获取崩溃前详细日志原文\n[ ] [step3] kubectl get events - 检查是否有 Liveness probe failed 或 Killing 事件\n[ ] [step4] 综合所有证据，判断 CrashLoopBackOff 直接原因\n[~] [step1] kubectl describe pod - 确认当前状态、Last State、Exit Code、Reason、重启次数、事件\n**Instructions**: Use TodoWrite tool to update task status as you work.", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/630dc3d24884401a-g1/tools/004-evidence-TodoWrite.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/630dc3d24884401a-g1/tools/004-evidence-TodoWrite.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/630dc3d24884401a-g1/tools/004-evidence-TodoWrite.summary.txt"}

