data: {"id": "630dc3d24884401a-thinking-parallel_evidence-2380", "run_id": "630dc3d24884401a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已有工具结果，我需要进一步采集以下证据来验证 CrashLoopBackOffRuntime 的直接原因：\n\n1. **获取崩溃前的日志原文** - 当前 kubectl_previous_logs 报错 \"unable to retrieve container logs\"，需要确认是容器已彻底清理还是其他问题\n2. **获取当前容器的详细日志** - kubectl_logs 显示了一条错误日志 \"runtime process exiting\"，需要更多上下文\n3. **查询 Pod 的 Topology 关系** - 确认 Owner、容器配置等\n4. **查询 Prometheus 指标** - 如果有的话，检查是否有OOM或其他资源问题\n\n让我开始采集这些证据：\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788437188592, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

