data: {"id": "630dc3d24884401a-thinking-parallel_evidence-3463", "run_id": "630dc3d24884401a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已有工具结果，快速整理关键证据并判断：\n\n**Pod 当前状态（已确认）**\n- Phase: Running；但 Ready=ContainersNotReady，app 容器 exitCode=2，restarts=7，reason=Error。\n- 事件：`Warning BackOff (x43 over 11m) Back-off restarting failed container app` → 仍在 CrashLoopBackOff 中。\n\n**崩溃直接原因（已明确）**\n- 当前日志与上次崩溃前日志均指向同一错误行：\n  `{\"event\":\"http_request\",\"level\":\"error\",\"message\":\"runtime process exiting\",\"http_status\":500,\"path\":\"/work\",\"case_run_id\":\"305f190e-67aa-49e6-8c95-fe124ec7d815\",\"trace_id\":\"7e44abc9dd661e8105277476f97b0561\"}`\n- 该日志表明 Python", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 8, "ts_ms": 1788437211305, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

